---
import Layout from '../layouts/Layout.astro';
import LeadForm from '../components/LeadForm.astro';
import {submitLead} from '../lib/leads';
import {site} from '../data/site';
import {env} from 'cloudflare:workers';
const result=Astro.request.method==='POST'?await submitLead(Astro.request,env):null;
if(result)Astro.response.status=result.status;
Astro.response.headers.set('Cache-Control','no-store');
---
<Layout title="Contact Peak Country | Mobile PDR in Greeley" description="Call, text, email or request an appointment for mobile auto hail repair and PDR serving Greeley, Weld County and nearby Northern Colorado communities." exactTitle><div class="page-head"><div class="eyebrow">Mobile service · Greeley and Northern Colorado</div><h1>Contact Peak Country</h1><p>Tell us about your vehicle and the damage. Service availability, a suitable mobile work location, and repair options are confirmed individually.</p></div><section class="section narrow"><div class="contact-direct"><p class="eyebrow">Contact information</p><h2><a href={`tel:${site.phone}`}>Call {site.phoneDisplay}</a></h2><p><a href={`sms:${site.phone}`}>Text {site.phoneDisplay}</a> with your name, city, vehicle, and a short description of the damage.</p>{site.email && <p>Email <a href={`mailto:${site.email}`}>{site.email}</a>.</p>}<p>Peak Country provides mobile Paintless Dent Repair by appointment in Greeley, Weld County, and surrounding Northern Colorado communities. No public walk-in storefront is advertised.</p></div><div class="prose"><h2>Information that helps us respond</h2><p>Include the vehicle year, make, and model; the city where service is requested; the panel or panels involved; and whether the damage followed a hailstorm or an everyday dent. Photographs can help begin the conversation, but they do not replace inspection lighting or a direct repairability assessment.</p><h2>What happens next</h2><p>Peak Country confirms whether the request fits the mobile service area and discusses an inspection appointment. During an inspection, paint condition, dent depth, panel location, material, metal stretch, previous repairs, and safe access are considered. Insurance hail repairs and customer-pay work are both welcome, but coverage decisions remain with the insurer.</p><p>For a hail-specific request, use the <a href="/free-hail-inspection/">Free Hail Inspection page</a>. You can also review the <a href="/service-area/">mobile service area</a>, <a href="/process/">inspection and repair process</a>, or <a href="/faq/">common repair questions</a> before contacting us.</p></div>{result&&<div role="status" class={result.ok?'success':'error'}>{result.message}{!result.ok&&<p>For your privacy, form entries are not retained on this page. Re-enter them before trying again.</p>}</div>}{!result?.ok&&<LeadForm source="/contact/" />}</section></Layout>
